From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zerollama <zerollama@local>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 01:39:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] kv grow/shrink in place without llama_init_from_model

Grow and shrink llama_kv_cache buffers without llama_free /
llama_init_from_model. Copies (or packs) live cells, swaps K/V tensors,
updates n_ctx_seq, re-reserves graphs. C API llama_n_ctx_grow /
llama_n_ctx_shrink; llama-server POST /kv/grow and /kv/shrink (idle slots).
Shrink fails if live tokens do not fit.
